# Estilizando ngx-datatable para replicar o DataTable do Angular (Material)

O `ngx-datatable` gera suas próprias classes (ex.: `.dt-row`, `.dt-cell`, `.dt-sortable-column`, etc.), então você precisa criar um CSS que **mapeie essas classes para as classes do Material (`mdc-table-*`)** ou simplesmente sobrescreva os estilos internos do ngx-datatable com o design do seu DataTable.

Abaixo segue um arquivo CSS completo e comentado que replica visualmente o padrão do `Angular DataTable` (que usa Bootstrap + temas próprios). Ajuste os nomes de cores conforme sua paleta.

---

## `styles/datatable-ngx.css`

```css
/* ============================================================
   ESTILIZAÇÃO ngx-datatable → Visual DataTable Angular (Bootstrap+Material)
   ============================================================ */

/* ---------- Reset base ---------- */
.dt-wrapper {
  --dt-border-color: #dee2e6;
  --dt-header-bg:     #0d6efd; /* azul bootstrap */
  --dt-header-text:   #ffffff;
  --dt-zebra:         #f8f9fa;
  --dt-hover-bg:      #e9ecef;
  --dt-selected-bg:   #e7f3ff;
  --dt-font-size:     0.875rem;
  --dt-font-family:   var(--font-sans-serif);
  border-collapse:    collapse;
  width: 100%;
}

/* ---------- Container wrapper do ngx-datatable ---------- */
.dt-wrapper .dt-bootstrap-container {
  overflow-x: auto;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
}

/* ---------- Header ---------- */
.dt-wrapper .dt-top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  background: var(--dt-header-bg);
  color: var(--dt-header-text);
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-top .dt-title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-search-input {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  outline: none;
  color: inherit;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
  min-width: 180px;
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-search-label {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  opacity: 0.8;
  margin-right: 0.5rem;
}

/* ---------- Tabela principal ---------- */
.dt-wrapper table.dt-simple {
  font-size: var(--dt-font-size);
  color: #212529;
}

/* Colunas */
.dt-wrapper thead th {
  background: rgba(13, 102, 237, 0.08);
  color: #0d6efd;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
  vertical-align: middle;
  white-space: nowrap;
  user-select: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--dt-border-color);
  transition: background .15s, color .15s;
}

.dt-wrapper thead th[aria-sort]::after {
  content: " \25B6 ";       /* ↑ */
  font-size: 0.7em;
  margin-left: 4px;
  color: #adb5bd;
}

.dt-wrapper thead th.sort-asc::after  { content: " \25B2 "; } /* ↑ */
.dt-wrapper thead th.sort-desc::after { content: " \25BC "; } /* ↓ */

/* Ícone de sort via span interno do ngx-datatable */
.dt-wrapper thead th .dt-column-icon {
  opacity: 0.5;
  margin-left: 4px;
}

/* Body */
.dt-wrapper tbody tr {
  transition: background .15s ease;
}

.dt-wrapper tbody tr:not(:nth-child(even)) {
  background: var(--dt-zebra);
}

.dt-wrapper tbody tr:hover {
  background: var(--dt-hover-bg);
}

.dt-wrapper tbody tr.selected {
  background: var(--dt-selected-bg);
}

.dt-wrapper td {
  padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
  vertical-align: middle;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dt-border-color);
}

.dt-wrapper th,
.dt-wrapper td {
  padding-left: 1rem;
  padding-right: 1rem;
}

/* Alinhamento por célula (via data-th-alignment no HTML) */
.dt-wrapper td[data-th-align="left"]  { text-align: left; }
.dt-wrapper td[data-th-align="center"] { text-align: center; }
.dt-wrapper td[data-th-align="right"] { text-align: right; }

/* ---------- Botões / Actions do header ---------- */
.dt-wrapper .dt-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.dt-wrapper button.dt-btn,
.dt-wrapper [ng-class*="dt-btn"] {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--dt-border-color);
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: #fff;
  color: #0d6efd;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all .15s;
}

.dt-wrapper button.dt-btn:hover,
.dt-wrapper [ng-class*="dt-btn"]:hover {
  background: var(--dt-selected-bg);
  color: #0d6efd;
}

.dt-wrapper button.dt-btn-primary {
  background: var(--dt-header-bg);
  color: var(--dt-header-text);
  border-color: var(--dt-header-bg);
}

.dt-wrapper button.dt-btn-primary:hover {
  background: #0b5ed7;
}

/* ---------- Paginação ---------- */
.dt-wrapper .dt-pagination {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2px;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  padding: 0.5rem 0;
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-page-btn {
  min-width: 36px;
  height: 32px;
  border: 1px solid var(--dt-border-color);
  background: #fff;
  color: #495057;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0 6px;
  transition: all .15s;
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-page-btn:hover:not(.dt-page-btn-active) {
  background: var(--dt-hover-bg);
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-page-btn-active {
  background: var(--dt-header-bg);
  color: var(--dt-header-text);
  border-color: var(--dt-header-bg);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.dt-wrapper .dt-page-info {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: #6c757d;
}

/* ---------- Filtros / Select dropdowns dentro da tabela ---------- */
.dt-wrapper select.dt-select,
.dt-wrapper input[type="text"].dt-input {
  font-size: inherit;
  border: 1px solid var(--dt-border-color);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
  background: #fff;
  color: #212529;
}

.dt-wrapper select.dt-select:focus,
.dt-wrapper input[type="text"].dt-input:focus {
  border-color: #0d6efd;
  outline: none;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(13,102,237,.15);
}

/* ---------- Scroll horizontal (wrapper responsivo) ---------- */
.dt-wrapper .dt-scroll-container {
  min-height: 100%;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

/* ---------- Responsividade ---------- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .dt-wrapper thead th,
  .dt-wrapper td {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .dt-wrapper .dt-top {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dt-wrapper .dt-actions {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
}
```

